(20596: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: parity%2Fgrammars%2Fnative%2Fgo.lino%20is%20a%20canonical%20native%20Links%20Notation%20grammar%20that%20js%2Fscripts%2Fimport-native-grammars.mjs%20imports%20from%20the%20pinned%20src%2Fgrammar.json%20of%20tree-sitter-go%200.25.0%2C%20with%20every%20rule%20renamed%20to%20its%20English%20name%20and%20its%20concept%20merged%20into%20the%20shared%20concepts%2C%20and%20every%20hand%20decision%20recorded%20in%20parity%2Fgrammars%2Fmerge-reports%2Fgo.json.%20Both%20executors%20build%2C%20for%20every%20source%20of%20the%20upstream%20test%2Fcorpus%20the%20oracle%20accepts%20and%20for%20hand-written%20sources%2C%20exactly%20the%20concrete%20syntax%20tree%20rows%20of%20the%20tree-sitter-go%20oracle%20with%20no%20ambiguity%3A%20packages%20and%20imports%2C%20functions%2C%20methods%20and%20generic%20type%20parameters%2C%20constants%20with%20iota%2C%20variables%2C%20type%20declarations%20and%20aliases%2C%20struct%2C%20interface%2C%20map%2C%20slice%2C%20array%2C%20pointer%2C%20function%20and%20channel%20types%2C%20short%20variable%20declarations%2C%20assignments%2C%20increments%2C%20if%2C%20for%2C%20range%2C%20switch%2C%20type%20switch%20and%20select%20statements%2C%20go%2C%20defer%2C%20labels%2C%20goto%20and%20break%2C%20channel%20sends%20and%20receives%2C%20composite%20literals%2C%20function%20literals%2C%20calls%2C%20generic%20calls%2C%20type%20conversions%2C%20index%2C%20slice%20and%20selector%20expressions%2C%20type%20assertions%2C%20raw%20and%20interpreted%20string%20literals%2C%20rune%2C%20integer%2C%20float%20and%20imaginary%20literals%20and%20comments%20included.%20Both%20executors%20reject%20invalid%20input%20the%20oracle%20recovers%20from%20and%20keep%20every%20source%20byte%2C%20comments%20and%20white%20space%20included%2C%20in%20the%20tree.) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
